  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AniTerrAE - Animals in Territories for Agroecology: Contribution of differentiation approaches to sustainable and resilient food systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO will produce a technical report providing recommendations for assessing the impact of differentiation approaches (e.g. product certification, GIAHS) on sustainability. It will be based on a series of applications of the Tool for Agroecolgy Performance Evaluation (TAPE) in different countries.</narrative>
  </description>
